<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose - April 9 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose - April 9 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED APRIL 9</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............806,200 up.....5,500</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......720,100 up.....5,300</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......552,800 up.....7,700</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....840,554 up ....2,125</p>
<p> Financial companies.......652,741 up.....1,222</p>
<p> New York business loans....45,344 down.....777</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......45,079 down.....768</p>
</text>
